{
    "_comment": [
        "Stream-K on the gfx1250 TDM pipelines (comp_tdm, comp_tdm_v2, comp_tdm_v3), persistent",
        "and non-persistent, every reduction strategy; not part of the default sweep.",
        "The pipeline gates keep each pipeline's own wave maps (comp_tdm_v2: 4 waves,",
        "comp_tdm_v3: 2x2x1 and 4x4x1) and epilogues (atomic: cshuffle; linear and tree:",
        "cshuffle or tdm). TDM kernels are unpadded: the TDM loads and the TDM epilogue clip",
        "every shape; the CShuffle epilogue needs N to be a multiple of tile_n.",
        "The warp tiles cover 16-bit (16x16x32) and 8-bit (16x16x128, 32x32x128) A/B;",
        "each dtype keeps the ones its warp-tile table lists.",
        "Usage: python streamk_gemm_full_benchmark.py gemm_streamk/configs/gfx1250_tdm_config.json",
        "  --arch gfx1250 --dtype bf16 --verify [--budget-pct 100,50]"
